          "body": "| Item | Approximate Price |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Motorcycle | $5,000–$15,000 |\n| Used car | $8,000–$20,000 |\n| Professional laptop | $800–$1,500 |\n| Basic surveillance kit | $500–$2,000 |\n| Semi-professional camera | $1,000–$3,000 |\n| Apartment rent, major city (monthly) | $1,500–$3,000 |\n| Legal fees, single case | $2,000–$5,000 |\n| Basic body armor | $500–$1,500 |\n| Night vision goggles | $300–$1,000 |\n| Encrypted satellite phone | $800–$2,000 |"
