          "level": 4,
          "title": "Medium Power Elemental Master",
          "body": "**Ability Scores**\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 12 (+1) | 14 (+2) | 16 (+3) | 12 (+1) | 14 (+2) | 14 (+2) | 16 (+3) | 14 (+2) |\n\n**Power Tier:** Medium Power | **HP:** 52 | **Speed:** 35 ft | **Tier Bonus:** \\+3\n\n**Active Defense:** Parry/Block 16, Dodge 17, Willpower 17, Social 18 | **Attack Value:** 15\n\n**Power Sets:** Choose one Energy or Elemental Power Set at Core Track 2 (INT or WIS governs)\n\n- At-Will elemental attack: Attack \\+6 vs Dodge, 2d10+3 \\[14\\] damage, Short range  \n- Encounter area effect: Attack \\+6 vs Dodge, 3d10+3 \\[19\\] damage, Short area  \n- Immunity to own element  \n- Resistance to one additional related element  \n- Energy Flight: Flying speed Short per Turn\n\n**Skills:** Notice (trained), Acrobatics (trained), Science (trained) **Talents:** Alert, Team Player, Innovative **Merits:** None | **Flaws:** Enemy (Rating 2), Loved One (Rating 1\\)\n\n**Notes:** Confident and capable. Has learned to control their power precisely. Will shape elemental attacks to minimize collateral damage when allies or civilians are in the area."
