          "body": "**Ability Scores**\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 12 (+1) | 16 (+3) | 16 (+3) | 14 (+2) | 22 (+6) | 16 (+3) | 16 (+3) | 16 (+3) |\n\n**Power Tier:** High Power | **HP:** 84 | **Speed:** 35 ft | **Tier Bonus:** \\+4\n\n**Active Defense:** Parry/Block 19, Dodge 20, Willpower 20, Social 23 | **Attack Value:** 20\n\n**Power Sets:** Gadgetry 3 (INT governs), Armor Systems 2\n\n- Full Gadgetry suite: All At-Will, Encounter, and Daily powers available  \n- Nano-Swarm (Encounter): Biological or technological targeting, Medium area  \n- Impossible Device (Daily): Solve one major scene problem  \n- Armor: \\+3 Active Defense, Environmental Sealing, Sensor Suite  \n- System Disruption (Encounter): Overloaded and Power Disrupted on failed INT Effect Value 20  \n- Scene Solution (Utility): Auto-succeed one technical challenge per scene\n\n**Skills:** Technology (trained, Advantage), Acrobatics (trained), Notice (trained), Influence (trained), Science (trained) **Talents:** Alert, Natural Born Leader, Innovative, Pack Rat **Merits:** Cash Flow (Rating 3), Resources (Rating 3\\) | **Flaws:** Loved One (Rating 2), Rogues Gallery (Rating 2\\)\n\n**Notes:** The most prepared hero in any room. Has contingencies for contingencies. Their weakness is being caught without preparation time, which smart opponents will try to arrange.\n\n---"
