          "level": 4,
          "title": "High Power Mage",
          "body": "**Ability Scores**\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 12 (+1) | 14 (+2) | 16 (+3) | 12 (+1) | 22 (+6) | 20 (+5) | 16 (+3) | 14 (+2) |\n\n**Power Tier:** High Power | **HP:** 84 | **Speed:** 30 ft | **Tier Bonus:** \\+4\n\n**Active Defense:** Parry/Block 17, Dodge 18, Willpower 21, Social 23 | **Attack Value:** 19\n\n**Power Sets:** Sorcery 3 (WIS governs), Astral Detection\n\n- Full Sorcery suite including Eldritch Storm (Daily): 6d12 \\[39\\] maximum damage, Medium area  \n- Supreme Sorcery Apex: Counterspell auto-succeeds once per day  \n- Dispel Magic (Utility): End magical effects  \n- Dimensional Shunt (Encounter): Banished on failed WIS Effect Value 19  \n- Levitation: Flying speed Short per Turn  \n- Ritual Magic (Utility): Any Tier 1 or 2 effect from any Power Set with 10 minutes preparation\n\n**Skills:** Occult (trained, Advantage), Investigation (trained, Advantage), Notice (trained), Influence (trained) **Talents:** Alert, Iron-Willed, Fame, Extra Identity **Merits:** Fame (Rating 2), Secret Identity (Rating 2\\) | **Flaws:** Mystical Debt (Rating 2), Weirdness draws to them (Rating 1\\)\n\n**Notes:** One of the most versatile High Power heroes. Ritual Magic means they can theoretically do anything given time. The Mystical Debt Flaw fires regularly as the GM introduces obligations from the forces they draw on.\n\n---"
