          "level": 4,
          "title": "Medium Power Speedster",
          "body": "**Ability Scores**\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 12 (+1) | 18 (+4) | 18 (+4) | 14 (+2) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) | 10 (+0) | 12 (+1) |\n\n**Power Tier:** Medium Power | **HP:** 56 | **Speed:** 60 ft | **Tier Bonus:** \\+3\n\n**Active Defense:** Parry/Block 16, Dodge 18, Willpower 14, Social 14 | **Attack Value:** 17\n\n**Power Sets:** Super Speed 2 (DEX governs)\n\n- 2 Speed Actions per Turn  \n- Speed Strike (Speed Action): Attack \\+7 vs Parry/Block at Disadvantage, 2d10+4 \\[15\\] damage  \n- Whirlwind (Encounter): Move through Zone hitting multiple targets  \n- Rapid Interpose (Encounter Reaction): Intercept attack on ally  \n- Wall Run and Water Run (Utility)\n\n**Skills:** Acrobatics (trained, Advantage), Athletics (trained), Notice (trained) **Talents:** Alert, Good Reflexes (Advantage on Initiative), Team Player **Merits:** None | **Flaws:** Enemy (Rating 2), Relationship (Rating 2\\)\n\n**Notes:** Two Speed Actions per Turn creates genuine action economy pressure. Rapid Interpose makes them an unexpected defensive hero. Will rarely stand still."
