          "level": 4,
          "title": "High Power Social Manipulator",
          "body": "**Ability Scores**\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 12 (+1) | 20 (+5) | 16 (+3) | 20 (+5) | 16 (+3) | 16 (+3) | 24 (+7) | 18 (+4) |\n\n**Power Tier:** High Power | **HP:** 84 | **Speed:** 45 ft | **Tier Bonus:** \\+4\n\n**Active Defense:** Parry/Block 23, Dodge 23, Willpower 21, Social 24 | **Attack Value:** 21\n\n**Power Sets:** Martial Mastery 3 (FIG governs combat), Telepathy 2 (WIS governs mental), Super Presence 2 (CHA governs presence)\n\n- Full martial suite at High Power  \n- Empathy: Automatically know emotional state and immediate desires of any creature within Short range  \n- Compel (Encounter): Charmed on failed WIS Effect Value 21  \n- Psychic Domination (Encounter): Controlled on failed WIS Effect Value 21, once per target per encounter  \n- Commanding Presence (Utility): Shift group Response one step as free action per scene  \n- Legendary Entrance (Utility): Arrival shifts Response of all non-enemy groups one step once per session  \n- Aura of Dread (Encounter): All enemies within Short range Shaken/Frightened\n\n**Skills:** Acrobatics (trained, Advantage), Athletics (trained), Stealth (trained), Finesse (trained), Insight (trained, Advantage), Influence (trained, Advantage), Medicine (trained) **Talents:** Alert, Appeal (Level 3), Cash Flow, Taunting **Merits:** Cash Flow (Rating 2), Fame (Rating 1\\) | **Flaws:** Jinx (Rating 1), Split Personality (Rating 3\\)\n\n**Notes:** Social Defense 24 means social confrontation is almost impossible without exceptional CHA. Psychic Domination combined with Super Presence creates a villain who can shift the allegiances of entire organizations. The Split Personality Flaw at Rating 3 means their alternate persona may have conflicting loyalties.\n\n---"
