          "id": "chapter-seventeen-npc-and-opponents-officer",
          "level": 4,
          "title": "Officer",
          "body": "**Tier:** Lieutenant (3 hits to defeat) | **Power Tier:** Support Tier | **Tier Bonus:** \\+1\n\n**Ability Scores**\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 12 (+1) | 12 (+1) | 12 (+1) | 12 (+1) | 12 (+1) | 12 (+1) | 14 (+2) | 12 (+1) |\n\n**Attack Value:** 12 | **Damage:** Handgun 1d8+1 \\[5\\] piercing, Short range\n\n**Equipment:** Tactical armor (body only)\n\n**Skills:** Influence (trained), Culture (trained)\n\n**Special:** All friendly Soldiers within Short range (25–50 ft) gain \\+1 to Attack Values while this Officer is conscious and in command.\n\n**Notes:** The morale anchor of any military unit. Defeating the Officer shifts all unit Minions' Response one step toward Resistant or Hostile depending on whether the heroes showed restraint."
