          "body": "**Tier:** Thug (1 hit to defeat) | **Power Tier:** Support Tier | **Tier Bonus:** \\+1\n\n**Ability Scores**\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 10 (+0) | 10 (+0) | 10 (+0) | 10 (+0) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) |\n\n**Attack Value:** Not a combatant\n\n**Equipment:** Phone, designer clothing, car\n\n**Skills:** Culture (trained), Influence (trained)\n\n**Notes:** May be a patron, a victim, a reluctant ally, or a villain hiding behind corporate legitimacy. Their wealth and connections are their primary capability.\n\n---"
