          "id": "chapter-eighteen-ready-to-play-templates-the-mystic-mid-level",
          "level": 3,
          "title": "The Mystic — Mid-Level",
          "body": "*The world is older and stranger than anyone admits. You know because you work there.*\n\nDimensional Step for positioning without line of sight. Ward shapes the battlefield. Curse every turn as a free Bonus Action adds consistent pressure at zero Action cost.\n\n**Class:** Warden  |  **Origin:** Mystic  |  **Hit Die:** d8  |  **Power Die:** d10  |  **Speed:** 30 ft **HP:** 44 *(d8 max \\+ CON score 14)x2)*  |  **PRO:** \\+2  |  **Starting Edge:** 2  |  **Save Training:** WIS, CON\n\nAbility Scores\n\n| Strength\u000b(STR) | Dexterity\u000b(DEX) | Constitution\u000b(CON) | Fighting\u000b(FIG) | Intelligence\u000b(INT) | Wisdom\u000b(WIS) | Charisma\u000b(CHA) | Perception\u000b(PER) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 10 / \\+0 | 12 / \\+1 | 14 / \\+2 | 8 / \\-1 | 15 / \\+2 | 20 / \\+5 | 17 / \\+3 | 13 / \\+1 |\n\n*Origin (Mystic) applies \\+2 WIS, \\+1 CHA before the above scores.*\n\nActive Defense \\*(roll 1d20 \\+ bonus shown; bonus \\= modifier \\+ PRO)\n\n| Parry/Block (FIG) | Dodge (DEX) | Willpower (WIS) | Social (CHA) | Initiative |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1d20+2 | 1d20+4 | 1d20+8 | 1d20+7 | 1d20+2 |\n\n**Effect Value (WIS):** 10 \\+ \\+5 \\+ PRO \\= **17**\n\n*Eldritch Bolt uses INT+PRO to hit vs Willpower.*\n\nOrigin — Mystic\n\n| Score bonuses | \\+2 WIS, \\+1 CHA |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| **Origin Skill** | Occult |\n| **Built-in Merit** | Mystic Attunement 1 |\n| **Built-in Flaw** | Supernatural Burden 1 |\n| **Origin Talent** | **Ward the Soul:** Once/encounter, when you or an ally within 30 ft makes a save against fear, charm, possession, curse, psychic intrusion, or mystical manipulation, add PRO (+2) to that roll. |\n\nPower Sets\n\n* **Sorcery 2** *(WIS governs)* — Command of dimensional and binding magic. Wards persist between encounters.  \n    \n* **Spirit Touch 1** *(WIS governs)* — Communicate with and influence nearby spirits.\n\nPowers\n\n**Eldritch Bolt** *(At-Will · Action):* Attack 1d20+1 (INT+PRO) vs Willpower. 2d10−1 \\[10\\] psychic. **Curse** *(At-Will · Bonus Action):* WIS Effect Value **17** vs Willpower. On failure: Disadvantage on their next attack roll or save. **Mystic Binding** *(Encounter · Action):* WIS Effect Value **17** vs STR. Restrained. **Ward** *(Encounter · Action):* Magical barrier at Short range. Creatures crossing: WIS save vs EV **17** or Pushed back and Dazed. **Dimensional Step** *(Encounter · Bonus Action):* Teleport up to Short range. No line of sight required. **Personal Force Field** *(Encounter · Reaction):* Reduce incoming damage by 2d10+5 \\[16\\]. **Spirit Sight** *(Utility):* See invisible creatures, spirits, and dimensional rifts within Short range.\n\nClass Features \\*(Level 1 only)\n\n* **Inner Fortress:** Advantage on WIS saves. Immune to being Charmed.  \n    \n* **Still Center:** Once/encounter as a Bonus Action, end one mental condition on yourself or one ally within Close range.\n\nSkills\n\nOccult *(Origin)* · Notice · Insight · Influence\n\nTalents \\*(Level 1 — two total)\n\n* **Origin Talent:** Ward the Soul  \n    \n* **Starting Talent:** Iron-Willed — \\*Advantage on WIS saves against mental effects.\n\nCalling — Idealist\n\n* **1 Edge:** Uphold your code in a situation where doing so creates real friction or disadvantage.  \n    \n* **2 Edge:** Refuse to compromise your ideal when confronted by power, facing real consequences.  \n    \n* **3 Edge:** Be genuinely tested in your conviction and pay something real to hold it.\n\nMerits & Flaws\n\n**Merits:** Mystic Attunement 1 *(Origin)* · Mentor 1\n\n**Flaws:** Supernatural Burden 1 *(Origin)* · Enemy 2 *(occult)* · Secret 1\n\n**Playing this hero:** Dimensional Step for positioning without line of sight. Ward shapes the battlefield. Curse every turn as a Bonus Action adds consistent pressure at zero Action cost. Spirit Sight reveals things nobody else can perceive.\n\n---"
